            "title": "Festa Major la Creu Alta 2026",
            "summary": "Aquest any 2026 la Festa Major de la Creu Alta, organitzada per la Coordinadora Jove de la Creu Alta \"Llamps i Trons\" i&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p> </p>\n<p>Aquest any 2026 la Festa Major de la Creu Alta, organitzada per la Coordinadora Jove de la Creu Alta \"Llamps i Trons\" i l'Associació Veïnal del barri, serà del <strong>22 al 24 de Maig</strong>.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"true\" data-translation=\"Add images\"> </div></div>\n<figure class=\"post__image post__image--center\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/Cartell-FM.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"474\" height=\"670\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px\" srcset=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/responsive/Cartell-FM-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/responsive/Cartell-FM-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/responsive/Cartell-FM-md.jpeg 768w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/responsive/Cartell-FM-lg.jpeg 1024w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/responsive/Cartell-FM-xl.jpeg 1360w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/responsive/Cartell-FM-2xl.jpeg 1600w\"></figure>\n<h2>Proves puntuables i concerts de FM</h2>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--full\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"2\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/gallery/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-07-at-22.29.01.jpeg\" data-size=\"1080x1350\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/gallery/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-07-at-22.29.01-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"Concerts de FM\" width=\"720\" height=\"900\"></a>\n<figcaption>Concerts de FM 2026</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/gallery/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-22-at-19.36.24.jpeg\" data-size=\"1080x1350\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/8/gallery/WhatsApp-Image-2026-04-22-at-19.36.24-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"Proves puntuables\" width=\"720\" height=\"900\"></a>\n<figcaption>Proves puntuables de FM 2026</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div></div>\n<h2> </h2>\n<p> </p>",
