            "summary": "Ves escalfant motors que la Festa Major de La Creu Alta està a tocar!✨ Serà any Tro o any Llamp? Us hi esperem&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p> </p>\n<p>Ves escalfant motors que la Festa Major de La Creu Alta està a tocar!✨<br>Serà any Tro o any Llamp? <br>Us hi esperem a totes per lluitar pel vostre equip i que tremoli el barri un any més!💛💙🌩️</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9288%;\"><a href=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/CARTELL.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><figure class=\"post__image post__image--center\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/CARTELL-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"1424\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px\" srcset=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/CARTELL-2-xs.jpg 300w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/CARTELL-2-sm.jpg 480w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/CARTELL-2-md.jpg 768w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/CARTELL-2-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/CARTELL-2-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/CARTELL-2-2xl.jpg 1600w\"></figure></a></td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9288%;\"><a href=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/PUNTUABLES.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><figure class=\"post__image post__image--center\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/PUNTUABLES-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"1424\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px\" srcset=\"https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/PUNTUABLES-2-xs.png 300w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/PUNTUABLES-2-sm.png 480w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/PUNTUABLES-2-md.png 768w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsive/PUNTUABLES-2-lg.png 1024w ,https://lacreualtallampsitrons.cat/media/posts/7/responsiv